SUMMARY:Live Experimental / Noise / Harsh Fun / Electronics / Synthesis 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20260904T180000Z
DTEND:20260904T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Live Experimental / Noise / Harsh Fun / Electronics / Synthesis
  from: Isn’tses (UK) Ritualistic masked intergalactic duo (Lisa McKendri
 ck & Tim Drage) creating high-intensity electronic music with noise and ra
 ve elements\, all performed live using a DAWless setup of hardware synths\
 , samplers\, DIY circuits and obsolete videogame hardware. Creators of psy
 chogeographic noise synths including Chernobylizer\, Dark Harvestator and 
 Mars Roveriser. Touring to celebrate the launch of their new cassette albu
 m “Throwing a Shoe into a Black Hole”. Lisa McKendrick (NNJA RIOT) · 
 Tim Drage (Cementimental) · Chernobylizer Synth Psychiceyeclix (UK) Proli
 fic circuit bender playing unique electronic instruments & recycled circui
 t bent devices\, hacked games consoles\, modified toys and robot masks to 
 create an improvised set of breakbeat\, glitch\, noise & drum & bass. Psyc
 hiceyeclix schoco mune Explosive\, noisy\, chaotic soundscapes with a stro
 ng focus on physicality and intuitive action. schocomune dagg3r & juxta Co
 llaboration between Dagg3r (Noise\, Drone\, Power Electronics\, field reco
 rdings) and juxta (electroacoustic\, noise\, ambient\, tekno\, speedcore\,
  abstract\, field recordings\, plunderphonics)
LOCATION:Vondelbunker Vondelpark 8a  Amsterdam Pays-Bas
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/node/593957
CATEGORIES:music/concert\,party
END:VEVENT
