DESCRIPTION:For a lot of us Instagram\, WhatsApp and Google have become par
 t of our everyday lives. That's why during Waag Open on 1 October\, we’r
 e on the hunt for the better alternatives.
LOCATION:Waag Futurelab\, Nieuwmarkt 4\, 1012CR Amsterdam
