BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3dc7e15b3f4c622c2a3f9b0aab44c9db32cc8285f36bfa98301d3cdb8d319037@pruts-
 agenda.local
DTSTAMP:20260829T131156Z
SUMMARY:The Cowan Paradox & Other Inconveniences
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261003T103000Z
DTEND:20261003T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:During NDSM OPEN\, we’ll open our studio to present artist Sj
 ef van Beers’ project The Cowan Paradox & Other Inconveniences\, includ
 ing a new experimental iteration on it. \nWithin this project Sjef explore
 s the relations between (domestic) labour\, (automation) technology and th
 e supermarket through the medium of the self-scanner. The Cowan Paradox\,
  named after historian Ruth Schwartz Cowan\, describes how time spent on h
 ousework had not decreased between 1870 and 1970\, despite innovations in 
 the household\, such  as the microwave or vacuum cleaner—the Industrial
  Revolution in the Home\, as Cowan puts it. More recent studies have show
 n that this paradox still holds today. Around the same time as domestic ap
 pliances entered our homes\, the supermarket started popping up and contri
 buted to turning the home from a place of production into one of consumpti
 on. With more and more labour being automated\, how do we want to organise
  our lives? What do we even see as labour? And what role has the supermark
 et played in shaping our daily lives and living habits? \nThroughout the d
 ay\, Sjef will take small groups of people on an experimental supermark
 et expedition. We’ll head to a nearby Albert Heijn—on the Ms Van Rie
 msdijkweg—for a demo for the next stage of this research project. Here\
 , we’ll try out an interactive narrative that runs on custom software on
  the self-scanners\, a point-and-scan adventure\, if you will. You’ll be
  one of the first people to try this\, as Sjef is still developing th
 is new chapter. Your experience as a test audience is very valuable. \n\
 n\n\n\nThe Hmm experiments…\nThis event is part of a series of programs 
 that we are developing with The Hmm\, where we give space in our studio fo
 r our community to explore new ideas and experiment with workshops as part
  of our public program. \n\nWhat you need to know\n\n📅 Date: Saturday 0
 3 October 2026\n🕗 Times: 12.30 – 16.00 CEST\n📍 Location: The Hmm
 ’s studio\, NDSM-plein 125\, 1033 WC Amsterdam\n🎟 Tickets: this exper
 ience is free to join\n\nYou can find information about physical accessibi
 lity at The Hmm’s studio here. \n\n💚 This programme is kindly support
 ed by the Creative Industries Fund NL
URL:https://thehmm.nl/event/the-cowan-paradox-other-inconveniences/
CATEGORIES:The Hmm
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
